<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech bank IPB lowers base lending rate.</title>
<headline>Czech bank IPB lowers base lending rate.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investicni a Postovni Banka a.s., the third largest Czech bank, said on Wednesday that it would lower its main lending rates by one full percentage point, effective July 10.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that it would lower its base rate for new credits to 20.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
